---- MODULE ProfileLoadTrace ----
\* Trace validation: replays runs of the real fx binary through ProfileLoad's
\* own actions.
\*
\* ProfileLoadObserved is generated by tests/tla/drivers/mcp_config/driver.ts.
\* It defines Observed, a sequence of records [file, loaded, noted, failed,
\* warned]: the entries of one profile mcp.json in the file's order, and per
\* surface the entries fx ran or listed and the entries it named as skipped.
\*   cli     `fx mcp list --json` and the notes on its stderr
\*   acp     the servers named in the first model request of an ACP session
\*           with profileMcpServers, and its "skipped" trace lines
\*   status  `fx status --json`: mcp.servers and mcp.configuration_issues
\*   doctor  `fx doctor --json`: mcp.servers and mcp.configuration_issues
\* For fx status and fx doctor, failed says the profile was reported as
\* unreadable (mcp_config_error in status, a failing mcp_config check in
\* doctor), and warned says it was reported as a warning (mcp_config_warning in
\* status, a warning mcp_config check in doctor).
\*
\* Each surface reads the file in its turn, the CLI first, then ACP, status,
\* and doctor: fx reads a file's entries in order, and the order doesn't change
\* what a surface ends with unless reading stops early, which the model allows
\* in any order. Observations are replayed in turn. The index k advances only
\* when every surface has read the file and ended exactly as observed. The run
\* is ACCEPTED when TLC violates NotAllMatched, which is reachable only after
\* every observation matched. A completed search means REJECTED.
EXTENDS ProfileLoad, ProfileLoadObserved

VARIABLE k
traceVars == <<vars, k>>

TraceInit == k = 1 /\ InitWith(Observed[1].file)

\* The surface reading now, and the next entry it reads.
Pending == {s \in Surfaces : ~Ended(s) /\ Turn(s)}
First(set) == CHOOSE e \in set : \A other \in set : e <= other

Step ==
    /\ k <= Len(Observed)
    /\ \E s \in Pending :
        \/ Finish(s)
        \/ todo[s] # {} /\ Read(s, First(todo[s]))
    /\ UNCHANGED k

Matches(o) ==
    /\ \A s \in Surfaces : Ended(s)
    /\ loaded = o.loaded
    /\ noted = o.noted
    /\ \A s \in InspectSurfaces :
        /\ o.failed[s] = (phase[s] = "failed")
        /\ o.warned[s] = (skipped[s] # {})

Reset(f) ==
    /\ file' = f
    /\ todo' = [s \in Surfaces |-> DOMAIN f]
    /\ loaded' = [s \in Surfaces |-> {}]
    /\ skipped' = [s \in Surfaces |-> {}]
    /\ noted' = [s \in Surfaces |-> {}]
    /\ phase' = [s \in Surfaces |-> "reading"]

Advance ==
    /\ k <= Len(Observed)
    /\ Matches(Observed[k])
    /\ k' = k + 1
    /\ IF k + 1 <= Len(Observed) THEN Reset(Observed[k + 1].file) ELSE UNCHANGED vars

TraceSpec == TraceInit /\ [][Step \/ Advance]_traceVars

\* Sentinel: violated exactly when every observation matched.
NotAllMatched == k <= Len(Observed)
====
